<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16483] Improve ComputeGridMonitor test coverage</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16483</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Fix flaky &lt;b&gt;ComputeJobChangePriorityTest#testChangeTaskPriorityAttribute&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The problem is in the test itself, there could be a rare race between completing a compute task and waiting for its attribute, so it was enough to add task completion after receiving the expected attribute.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add tests for &lt;b&gt;ComputeGridMonitor&lt;/b&gt; in case of a client node.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
